<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal; no human approval and no hgm_gloss promotion. Source English remains verbatim, including ‘less that what they really are’. Source food/drink is expanded into a subject and predicate in English; bza' btung owns the predicate occurrence following ‘really’. The second consumption/start clause and first skur ba comparison remain unbanked because their English is distributed; this is not a null judgment. The doubled snang ba construction is retained as a phrase-level contraction to ‘appearance’. Lexical skur ba in the closing clause owns ‘failure’; supplied laws/rules and auxiliaries remain outside the lexical pair. Full evidence, omissions and exact occurrence proof accompany this proposal.</div>
